flowchart TB
    raw["Raw request checks<br/>Definition, path, policy, key text<br/>Preserve original types; no codec/ECC work"]
    decode["Delegate Base58Check decode<br/>Require 78 bytes and valid common/root metadata"]
    version["Check all four public-version bytes<br/>Eligibility precedes point interpretation"]
    point["Validate recognized-version compressed point<br/>Then check explicit network/policy compatibility"]
    depth["Check path against remaining imported-node depth<br/>Before HMAC or any child derivation"]
    attempt["Take exactly the next supplied path component i<br/>HMAC-SHA512 with this parent's chain code<br/>Message: compressed parent key + ser32(i)"]
    scalar{"Left scalar a below curve order?"}
    curve["Delegate child-point construction<br/>K child = aG + K parent<br/>Zero a is valid; no modular repair of invalid a"]
    finite{"Child point finite?"}
    node["Build complete child node<br/>Right half becomes chain code; update depth and child number<br/>Parent fingerprint: first four bytes of HASH160(parent key)"]
    more{"More supplied path components?"}
    complete["Complete final derived node<br/>Exact requested path and original admitted context"]
    address["Continue this selected flow's address construction<br/>No universal HASH160 address-input requirement"]
    failure["Owned failure: abort invocation<br/>No next-index search, later stage or partial result"]
    rule["Any admission, capability or provider failure aborts<br/>The diamonds show CKDpub invalid-child cases"]
    raw --> decode --> version --> point --> depth --> attempt --> scalar
    scalar -->|yes| curve --> finite
    scalar -->|no| failure
    finite -->|yes| node --> more
    finite -->|no| failure
    more -->|yes: advance within the supplied path only| attempt
    more -->|no| complete --> address
    rule -. failure rule .-> failure
